  "summary": "EasyEDA Pro API skill for AI agents. Use when working with EasyEDA Pro EDA software, including PCB design, schematic editing, footprint/symbol management, and project operations. Supports live debugging in EasyEDA and EasyEDA extension development. Provides complete API reference (120+ classes, 62 enums, 70 interfaces), extension-development documentation, and a WebSocket bridge server to execute code in the running EasyEDA Pro client. Trigger on: \"\u5609\u7acb\u521bEDA\uff0c\u542f\u52a8\uff01\", \"\u7acb\u521bEDA\uff0c\u542f\u52a8\uff01\", \"EDA\uff0c\u542f\u52a8\uff01\", \"EasyEDA\", \"PCB\", \"schematic\", \"footprint\", \"EDA\", \"circuit board\", \"\u5609\u7acb\u521bEDA\", \"\u539f\u7406\u56fe\", \"PCB\u8bbe\u8ba1\". **IMPORTANT**: \u5609\u7acb\u521bEDA's English name is **EasyEDA**. They are the SAME product. Never use other transliterations like \"EasyEDA Pro\" (unless specifically versioned), \"EASYEDA\", \"easyeda\", etc. Always use \"EasyEDA\" for English references and \"\u5609\u7acb\u521bEDA\" for Chinese references.",
